<title>JAPAN: Shinmei Electric - 96/97 parent results.</title>
<headline>Shinmei Electric - 96/97 parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to January 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  8.60		vs	    7.57</p>
<p> Operating   loss 130    million    vs   loss 142    million</p>
<p> Current	    469    million    vs	  437    million</p>
<p> Net		  314    million    vs	  197    million</p>
<p> EPS		   51.73 yen	  vs	   32.48 yen</p>
<p> Diluted EPS	 51.73 yen	  vs	   32.48 yen</p>
<p> Shares		6 million	  vs	   6 million</p>
<p>NOTE - Shinmei Electric Co Ltd is diversifying from trimmer condensers to switches and counters.</p>
